codex
The final bare run is valid and hardened at easy, but both final G9 runs stopped after 2/3 scored failures because the OpenRouter key hit its total spending limit; the harness correctly refused to make a claim. This is an external evidence blocker, not a family failure. I’m preserving the partial final-renderer transcripts and checking whether the 403 includes any reset/retry information before deciding the honest handoff state.
